msgstr "stop 绝不虚构释放活动硬件 watchdog"

msgid "The exact implementations and configured limits remain authoritative:"
msgstr "精确实现与配置限值保持权威："

#: docs/design/soc-execution-budgets.md:49
msgid ""
"UART: `soc/*/*/drivers/uart*.c`; G474 and U575 use IRQ bytes. H743 RX also "
"uses IRQ bytes; its explicitly selected finite TX DMA has a separate "
"memory/Cache and drain contract. The F407, G474, H743 and U575 wire-drain "
"allowance is `20000000 / baud + 100` microseconds. GD IRQ uses its reviewed "
"reset-abort protocol; it is not assigned the ST wire-drain formula."
msgstr ""
"UART：`soc/*/*/drivers/uart*.c`；G474 和 U575 使用 IRQ 字节。H743 RX 也使用 IRQ "
"字节；显式选定的有限 TX DMA 有独立内存／Cache 与排空合同。F407/G474/H743/U575 的线侧排空余量为 `20000000 /"
" baud + 100` 微秒。GD IRQ 使用已审 reset-abort，不套用 ST 线侧排空公式。"

#: docs/design/soc-execution-budgets.md:54
msgid ""
"SPI: `soc/*/*/drivers/spi*.c`; the finite DMA drain allowance is 200 "
"microseconds."
msgstr "SPI：`soc/*/*/drivers/spi*.c`；有限 DMA drain 余量 200 微秒。"

msgid ""
"ADC/EXTI/timer: selected SoC driver and private state; scan, queue and "
"channel limits come from resolved inputs or explicit caller storage."
msgstr ""
"ADC/EXTI/timer：所选 SoC driver 和私有状态；scan、queue、channel 限值来自解析输入或显式调用方存储。"

#: docs/design/soc-execution-budgets.md:59
msgid ""
"CAN/USB/Ethernet: `io/src/controllers/can_controller.c`, "
"`usb_device_controller.c` and `eth_mac.c`; poll/drain limits and selected "
"capacities are validated at cold admission. IRQ notification remains a hint,"
" never a replacement for predicates."
msgstr ""
"CAN/USB/Ethernet：`io/src/controllers/can_controller.c`、`usb_device_controller.c`、`eth_mac.c`；poll/drain"
" 限制和所选容量在冷态准入校验。IRQ 通知只是提示，绝不替代谓词。"

msgid "Cost review and evidence"
msgstr "成本审查与证据"

msgid ""
"Keep the exact resolved configuration, compiler identity, flags, linked "
"ELF/map, resource budget and retention outputs together. Compare equivalent "
"CPU/ABI, backend, clock, memory layout and capacities. A source instruction "
"count, object-file size or different-capacity image cannot establish an "
"equivalent whole-image saving. Report Flash, static RAM, reservations and "
"caller storage separately. Disassembly is real tool output, not a cycle "
"measurement."
msgstr ""
"将精确解析配置、编译器身份、flags、链接 ELF/map、资源预算及 retention 输出一同保留。比较等价 "
"CPU/ABI、backend、clock、内存布局和容量。源码指令数、object 大小或不同容量镜像不能建立等价整镜像收益。分别报告 "
"Flash、static RAM、reservation 和调用方存储。反汇编是真实工具输出，不是周期测量。"

msgid ""
"`tools/measurement/soc_costs.py` observes actual linked functions and ELF "
"resource costs with complete raw command receipts and input/tool hashes. Its"
" comparison rejects changed routes, bindings, claims, backend or capacity "
"profiles rather than silently attributing their cost to an implementation "
"improvement. The empty versus selected and baremetal versus FreeRTOS "
"dimensions remain useful selection-cost reports, but are not same-profile "
"regression comparisons. The [SoC execution record](../delivery/soc-"
"refinement-verification.md) identifies the source scope of completed "
"observations and pending final baselines."
msgstr ""
"`tools/measurement/soc_costs.py` 观察实际链接函数与 ELF 资源成本，保留完整原始命令凭据及 input/tool "
"hash。比较拒绝 routes、bindings、claims、backend、capacity profile "
"改变，避免把它们静默归为实现优化成本。Empty／selected、baremetal／FreeRTOS 维度是有用选择成本报告，但不是相同 "
"profile 回归比较。[SoC 执行记录](../delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md)标明已完成观察的 "
"source scope 与 pending 最终基线。"

msgid ""
"For changed interrupt/concurrency behavior, GoogleTest/GoogleMock calls the "
"real production source with external register/CPU ports modeled. Record "
"actual RED, then GREEN; retain admission, loss ordering, cancel, quarantine,"
" wake and instance isolation regressions. ARM budget/retention verifies "
"actual linking. Software checks do not certify physical IRQ latency or DMA "
"throughput."
msgstr ""
"中断／并发行为变更时，GoogleTest/GoogleMock 调用真实生产源码，只模型化外部 register/CPU port。记录实际 RED "
"后 GREEN，保留 admission、loss ordering、cancel、quarantine、wake 及 instance "
"isolation 回归。ARM budget/retention 证明真实链接。软件检查不认证物理 IRQ latency 或 DMA "
"throughput。"

msgid ""
"No numerical maximum service interval is asserted without the selected "
"producer rate, storage, hardware and interference budget. External products "
"must qualify that interval and the resulting overload policy. A missed "
"service deadline cannot revoke an accepted request or block loan. Current "
"physical measurements remain not executed until an actual station records "
"them."
msgstr ""
"没有所选 producer rate、storage、hardware 和 interference budget，就不声明最大 service "
"interval 数值。外部产品须为该间隔及过载策略建立资格。错过 service deadline 不能撤销接受的 request 或 block "
"loan。当前物理测量均未执行，直到真实工位记录。"

msgid "I2C: `drivers/i2c/i2c_v1_async/i2c_v1_async.c` and the SoC wrappers; V1 async drain allowance is 1,000 microseconds. Polling STOP has separate finite work."
msgstr "I2C：`drivers/i2c/i2c_v1_async/i2c_v1_async.c` 与 SoC 包装；V1 async drain 余量 1,000 微秒，polling STOP 有独立有限工作。"
